## Visual Studio & ASP.NET MVC Git Ignore Rule
.vs/
bin/
obj/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

## Sensitive Configuration Files (Prevent API Key / Connection String Leak)
Web.config
Web.Debug.config
Web.Release.config

## App_Data Logs & Local Databases
App_Data/*.log
App_Data/*.ldf
App_Data/*.mdf
App_Data/sepay_transactions.log

## Packages & Temporary Files
packages/
*.nupkg
*.tmp
